   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "With the Supreme Court’s narrow interpretations of the Fourteenth and Fifteenth Amendments, by the late 1870s",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1171152,
     "content_html": "the Ku Klux Klan controlled elections in the South"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171151,
     "content_html": "events like the Colfax episode became more violent"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171153,
     "content_html": "the South transitioned to the political control of white majorities"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171150,
     "content_html": "African Americans held political power in the South"
    }
